WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:04.537 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.771
-I'm gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:08.475
President Biden visited
the Pentagon on Sunday

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:11.878
to commemorate the anniversary
of the September 11th attack

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:14.547
and said, "It's not enough
to stand up

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.149
for democracy once a year."

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:19.619
"I don't know, I'm making it
work," said Joe Manchin.

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.621
