a potential national

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.795
railroad strike,
but just in case,

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:30.263
Biden's ready if you need him.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.665
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.201
President Biden spoke
about his infrastructure plan

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.535
yesterday in Boston.

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:40.206
Said one Boston resident,
"Wow, I've never gotten a DUI

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.975
on a paved road before."

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.810
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.181
We could have given him a shirt.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.282
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.282 --> 00:00:52.619
According to the latest numbers
from the Bureau of Labor

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:54.687
statistics, gas prices
have decreased

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:58.058 line:0%
for 89 consecutive days,
or as Fox News reported it,

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.593 line:0%
"Biden leaves oil markets
in shambles."

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.662 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.830
Buckingham palace will
reportedly only extend

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.200
invites to Queen Elizabeth's
funeral to current

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.869
heads of state,
and no former presidents,

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.772
which is a bummer 'cause we all
kind of wanted to hear

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:13.973
that eulogy.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:17.544
"Elizabeth, she loved
everyone at Hogwarts."

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.079
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:21.748
"Even the gingers,
even the gingers."

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.516
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.352
"And if she were here,
I -- I know what she would say.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.755
She would say January 6th
was mostly antifa."

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:31.757
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:34.894
Apple yesterday released
its IOS 16 software,

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:38.531
which will allow iPhone users
to unsend messages,

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.667
and not a moment too soon.

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.702
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.239 --> 00:01:50.009
The Emmy Awards ceremony
was held last night.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.144
Our show was nominated
and, honey,

00:01:52.144 --> 00:01:54.214
clear some space on the mantle,

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.849
cause they had snow globes
at the airport.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:59.552
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.654
