00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.905
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.341
[ Audience "ohs" ]

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:23.943
That's why we win
the snow globes, baby.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.945
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.486
Princeton University
announced last week

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.288
