the same way he always does.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.002
"Ah, simpler times."

00:03:24.002 --> 00:03:26.506
President Biden today
toured the Detroit Auto Show.

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:28.041
And you're not
going to believe this.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:33.112
