in Minnesota.

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:46.759
The FBI says they weren't tipped
off about his location.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:49.662
They just assumed.

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:51.764
"Hey, they want us to get
Lindell's cellphone."

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:55.667
"Alright.
Hardee's drive-through?"

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:58.037
That's right -- MyPillow C.E.O.
Mike Lindell said

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:00.039
that FBI agents
seized his cellphone

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:01.440
