00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:27.266
President Biden said yesterday
during a celebration

00:04:27.266 --> 00:04:29.402
at The White House
that his recently passed

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.905
Inflation Reduction Act
is a win for the middle class.

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:36.242
"Thanks," said the one guy
still in it.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:39.312
That's right --
President Biden hosted

00:04:39.312 --> 00:04:41.113
a celebration at
The White House yesterday.

00:04:41.113 --> 00:04:43.583
They were originally going to
ask The Beach Boys,

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:47.287
but Biden said, "Let's get
someone the kids will like."

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.457
So, we -- Can we go back there?

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:53.192
What did I miss?

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:57.396
Go back. Yeah, okay.
One more card.

00:04:57.396 --> 00:05:01.668
So, we missed the part
that James Taylor played at it.

00:05:07.773 --> 00:05:12.812
And that's a detail we call
"key to the joke."

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:17.684
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:25.157
Now -- now,
halfway through the joke,

00:05:25.157 --> 00:05:28.127
I realized the problem, guys.

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.962
But I also --
There was no way --

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:31.397
And I feel like
I'm pretty good on my feet.

00:05:31.397 --> 00:05:35.233
There was no way
for me to fix it.

00:05:35.233 --> 00:05:37.002
Here's how it would have looked
if I tried to fix it

00:05:37.002 --> 00:05:38.003
the way I thought I would.

00:05:38.003 --> 00:05:39.905
Alright, ready?
Wally, thank you.

00:05:39.905 --> 00:05:42.307
That's right -- President Biden
hosted a celebration

00:05:42.307 --> 00:05:44.110
at The White House yesterday,
and they were gonna --

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.177
James Taylor was there.

00:05:45.177 --> 00:05:47.179
They were gonna originally --

00:05:47.179 --> 00:05:48.581
And they asked James Taylor --

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:51.184
They were going to originally
ask The Beach Boys.

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:55.688
How you feeling, Wally?

00:05:57.656 --> 00:05:59.125
-I'm not sure
that was my mistake.

00:05:59.125 --> 00:06:00.526
-Okay.

00:06:03.629 --> 00:06:04.897
Yeah. Yeah, that's true.

00:06:04.897 --> 00:06:06.933
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:11.670
It's always been a gray area
where cue cards land...

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:14.140
-Yeah.
-...and your responsibility.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.374
-Yeah, yeah.

00:06:15.374 --> 00:06:17.243
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.815
-During -- Well,
since he's wearing a mask,

00:06:22.815 --> 00:06:25.685
